VALUES ('doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p103-11', 'doc-04-nist-sp-800-86', '', 103, 'The following are additional questions for this scenario: 1. Given the time-sensitive nature of this scenario, how should analysts prioritize their actions? B-3', 'kb-doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p103-11', 0, 23, '04-nist-sp-800-86', 'retrieved', '38C7EAC5B1DA5EC0FA648BD093C6E0048012F09C970B33F507B3ABBE959007FF', 'v1', '{"source_id": "04-nist-sp-800-86", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
