VALUES ('doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p104-1', 'doc-04-nist-sp-800-86', '', 104, 'GUIDE TO INTEGRATING FORENSIC TECHNIQUES INTO INCIDENT RESPONSE 2. What other organization(s) should be contacted to mitigate potential cases of identity theft? Scenario 8: Encrypted Files An employee leaves an organization unexpectedly, and the employees manager is granted access to the former employees desktop computer to retrieve important project information that should be stored on it.', 'kb-doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p104-1', 0, 56, '04-nist-sp-800-86', 'retrieved', '3531EA856F88B7148ED020BC81EB52FCDAB018781380F53FBC28EB174537AB0A', 'v1', '{"source_id": "04-nist-sp-800-86", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
