VALUES ('doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p104-4', 'doc-04-nist-sp-800-86', '', 104, 'The following are additional questions for this scenario: 1. Who should determine how much effort should be put into attempting to recover the encrypted data? How would this be determined? 2. What changes could be made to the organizations policies, guidelines, and procedures to reduce the impact of similar future incidents?', 'kb-doc-04-nist-sp-800-86-p104-4', 0, 51, '04-nist-sp-800-86', 'retrieved', '70D697694174738D905774E97E18066B3831A73D49AB30379E2B2930876A39E0', 'v1', '{"source_id": "04-nist-sp-800-86", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
